  "memo": {
    "priority_issue": "issue-usability",
    "recommendation": "Prioritize reducing ad interruptions: this issue leads the saved priority ranking, and reviews describe ads appearing after only a song or two. Playback and connectivity is the strongest alternative, with fewer complaints but higher average severity; billing complaints rank next. Treat uninstall language as stated intent, not confirmed churn. This small pilot does not establish population-wide impact.",
    "alternatives": [
      "Playback and connectivity problems: fewer complaints, but higher average severity and the next-highest priority score. Investigate reported assistant playback failures and Wi-Fi connectivity.",
      "Premium features and pricing complaints: third in the priority ranking; review examples object to features being moved behind premium access."
    ],
    "limitations": "Evidence comes from a development pilot and cannot establish population-wide impact or actual churn. Reviews are illustrative, not proof of causality.",
